      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">title</span>\": \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"75 characters\">Levi&#039;s Men&#039;s Timeless Classic Denim Jacket with Iconic Style and Durability</span>\"
      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">slug</span>\": \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"75 characters\">levi&#039;s-men&#039;s-timeless-classic-denim-jacket-with-iconic-style-and-durability</span>\"
      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">summary</span>\": \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"190 characters\">The Levi&#039;s Men&#039;s Denim Jacket combines rugged style with modern comfort. Made from durable denim, this jacket is perfect for casual wear, offering both warmth and versatility for any season.</span>\"
      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">description</span>\": \"\"\"
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"893 characters\">&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Levi&#039;s Men&#039;s Denim Jacket&lt;/strong&gt; is a timeless wardrobe essential that adds a touch of rugged charm to any outfit. Crafted from premium denim, this jacket offers both durability and comfort, making it ideal for daily wear. The classic button-down front, chest pockets, and adjustable cuffs provide a perfect fit, while the slightly faded wash gives it a worn-in, vintage feel.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"893 characters\">&lt;p&gt;This jacket is designed for all-season wear, offering warmth in the cooler months and a stylish layer for warmer days. Whether you&#8217;re pairing it with a T-shirt for a laid-back look or layering it over a hoodie for extra warmth, the Levi&#039;s Denim Jacket is a versatile piece that complements any casual style.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"893 characters\">&lt;p&gt;With its iconic Levi&#039;s branding and timeless design, this jacket is perfect for both casual outings and weekend adventures, making it an essential piece for your wardrobe.&lt;/p&gt;</span>
        \"\"\"
