      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">title</span>\": \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"80 characters\">Men&#039;s Regular Fit Performance Sports Jersey for Active Wear and Everyday Comfort</span>\"
      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">slug</span>\": \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"80 characters\">men&#039;s-regular-fit-performance-sports-jersey-for-active-wear-and-everyday-comfort</span>\"
      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">summary</span>\": \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"225 characters\">The Men&#039;s Regular Fit Jersey offers the perfect balance of comfort and style. Made from soft, breathable fabric, it&#8217;s ideal for everyday wear, providing a relaxed fit and versatile look that pairs well with any casual outfit.</span>\"
      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">description</span>\": \"\"\"
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1054 characters\">&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Men&#039;s Regular Fit Jersey&lt;/strong&gt; is designed for maximum comfort and effortless style. Made from high-quality cotton blend fabric, this jersey is soft to the touch and highly breathable, making it perfect for daily wear. The regular fit ensures a relaxed, non-restrictive feel that keeps you comfortable all day long, whether you&#8217;re running errands, lounging at home, or meeting friends.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1054 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Featuring a simple crew neckline and short sleeves, this jersey offers a clean, minimalist look that easily complements any wardrobe. Available in a variety of classic colors, it&#8217;s easy to pair with jeans, shorts, or casual trousers for a laid-back, stylish outfit. The lightweight fabric also makes it ideal for layering or wearing on its own during warmer weather.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1054 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Durable and versatile, the &lt;strong&gt;Men&#039;s Regular Fit Jersey&lt;/strong&gt; is a wardrobe essential for men who value comfort and simplicity without compromising on style. Whether you&#8217;re relaxing or out on the go, this jersey will be a go-to for all your casual outfits.&lt;/p&gt;</span>
        \"\"\"
