      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">title</span>\": \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"72 characters\">Nike Essential Men&#039;s Training Shorts for Optimal Performance and Comfort</span>\"
      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">slug</span>\": \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"72 characters\">nike-essential-men&#039;s-training-shorts-for-optimal-performance-and-comfort</span>\"
      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">summary</span>\": \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"251 characters\">The Nike Men&#039;s Training Shorts are designed for ultimate comfort and flexibility during your workout. Made with lightweight, breathable fabric, these shorts provide freedom of movement and ensure you stay cool and dry throughout your training session.</span>\"
      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">description</span>\": \"\"\"
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"921 characters\">&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Nike Men&#039;s Training Shorts&lt;/strong&gt; are built to support your active lifestyle, whether you&#039;re hitting the gym, going for a run, or engaging in intense sports activities. Crafted from high-quality, moisture-wicking fabric, these shorts help keep you dry and comfortable by drawing sweat away from your skin. The lightweight material allows for easy movement, ensuring you stay focused on your performance without restriction.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"921 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Featuring an elastic waistband with an adjustable drawstring, the shorts provide a secure fit that can be customized for your comfort. The sleek design includes side pockets for convenient storage of essentials like keys or a phone. Perfect for any workout, the &lt;strong&gt;Nike Men&#039;s Training Shorts&lt;/strong&gt; offer both functionality and style, making them a versatile addition to your fitness wardrobe. Available in various colors, they pair well with any training gear.&lt;/p&gt;</span>
        \"\"\"
