      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">title</span>\": \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"72 characters\">Luxurious Soft Wool Blend Cardigan for Women with Cozy Comfort and Style</span>\"
      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">slug</span>\": \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"72 characters\">luxurious-soft-wool-blend-cardigan-for-women-with-cozy-comfort-and-style</span>\"
      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">summary</span>\": \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"185 characters\">This  Soft Wool Blend Cardigan offers a perfect mix of coziness and elegance. Crafted from a soft wool blend, it&#8217;s ideal for layering over any outfit to stay warm while looking stylish.</span>\"
      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">description</span>\": \"\"\"
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"885 characters\">&lt;p&gt;The<span class=sf-dump-default>\\u{A0}</span>&lt;strong&gt; Soft Wool Blend Cardigan&lt;/strong&gt; is a must-have for any wardrobe, offering a cozy and sophisticated style that transitions beautifully from casual to more refined looks. Made from a soft wool blend, this cardigan provides warmth and comfort, while the elegant design ensures a flattering fit. The button-down closure, ribbed cuffs, and hem add a touch of structure, making it easy to style with various outfits.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"885 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Whether you&#039;re layering it over a simple t-shirt, pairing it with a dress, or using it as a chic topper for jeans and boots, this cardigan adds effortless style to any ensemble. The neutral color options make it versatile enough to pair with everything from workwear to weekend attire.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"885 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Perfect for those chilly days or evenings, the Women&#039;s Soft Wool Blend Cardigan is an essential piece that combines practicality with timeless appeal.&lt;/p&gt;</span>
        \"\"\"
