      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">title</span>\": \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"66 characters\">Elegant Women&#039;s Premium Cotton Kurta for All-Day Comfort and Style</span>\"
      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">slug</span>\": \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"66 characters\">elegant-women&#039;s-premium-cotton-kurta-for-all-day-comfort-and-style</span>\"
      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">summary</span>\": \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"224 characters\">The Elegant Women&#8217;s Cotton Kurta is a perfect fusion of comfort and style, offering a graceful silhouette with intricate detailing. Ideal for festive occasions or casual wear, this kurta combines tradition with modern charm.</span>\"
      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">description</span>\": \"\"\"
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"835 characters\">&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Elegant Women&#8217;s Cotton Kurta&lt;/strong&gt; brings timeless elegance with a modern touch. Made from soft, breathable cotton, this kurta is designed to keep you comfortable throughout the day while maintaining a chic and flattering fit. The delicate embroidery on the neckline and sleeves adds a sophisticated charm, making it perfect for both casual outings and special occasions.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"835 characters\">&lt;p&gt;The kurta features a relaxed A-line silhouette with side slits, offering ease of movement while keeping the look polished. With its versatile design, it pairs effortlessly with leggings, palazzos, or straight-cut trousers. Whether you&#039;re attending a family gathering, celebrating a festival, or enjoying a casual day out, this kurta provides an effortlessly stylish option that combines traditional elegance with contemporary appeal.&lt;/p&gt;</span>
        \"\"\"
